---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy Policy | Findable Home"
    description="Learn how Findable Home handles personal information, analytics, cookies, affiliate links, and privacy-related requests."
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200/40">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
                        OUR POLICIES
                    </span>

                    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-5xl">
                        Privacy Policy
                    </h1>

                    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70">
                        Your privacy matters. Here's how Findable Home handles
                        information when you visit our website and explore our content.
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/70">
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">
                            Effective: October 10, 2026
                        </span>
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">
                            Updated: October 10, 2026
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
            <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
                <nav aria-label="Privacy policy contents" class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-base-content">
                        On this page
                    </h2>
                    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#information">1. Information collected</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#use">2. How we use information</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#analytics">3. Analytics</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#affiliates">4. Affiliate links</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#advertising">5. Advertising and email</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#sharing">6. Information sharing</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#security">7. Retention and security</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#choices">8. Privacy choices</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#children">9. Children's privacy</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#international">10. International visitors</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#changes">11. Policy changes</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 transition hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#contact">12. Contact us</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </aside>

            <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 text-base-content">
                <section class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 border-l-4 border-l-primary bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <p class="leading-7">
                        Findable Home ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy.
                        This Privacy Policy explains how information may be
                        collected, used, disclosed, and protected when you visit
                        <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">
                            https://findablehome.me/
                        </a>
                        or interact with our content and links.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Please read this policy carefully. By using the website,
                        you acknowledge that you have had the opportunity to review
                        it. Where applicable law requires consent, we will rely on
                        the appropriate legal basis rather than treating website
                        use alone as consent.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="information" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">1. Information We May Collect</h2>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Information You Provide</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        If you contact us by email or through a website form, we
                        may receive information such as your name, email address,
                        message, and any other information you choose to include.
                        Please avoid sending sensitive personal information unless
                        it is necessary for your request.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Technical and Usage Information</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        Depending on the website configuration and services in use,
                        technical information may include your IP address, browser
                        type, device information, referring page, pages visited,
                        approximate location derived from technical data, and
                        interaction information.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Cookies and Similar Technologies</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                        Cookies and similar technologies may be used by the website
                        or its integrated services to support functionality,
                        understand website usage, or measure interactions. The
                        technologies used depend on the services currently
                        configured on the website.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="use" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">2. How We Use Information</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">Information may be used to:</p>
                    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 marker:text-primary">
                        <li>Operate, maintain, and improve the website.</li>
                        <li>Respond to questions, feedback, and requests.</li>
                        <li>Understand website traffic and content performance.</li>
                        <li>Monitor for spam, misuse, security issues, and technical problems.</li>
                        <li>Measure visits and interactions with relevant links.</li>
                        <li>Meet legal obligations and protect our legitimate interests.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We do not intentionally request sensitive personal
                        information for ordinary browsing or household-organization
                        content.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="analytics" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">3. Analytics and Google Tag Manager</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home has Google Analytics configured through
                        Google Tag Manager for website measurement. The information
                        collected depends on which tags are published, how they
                        are configured, and any applicable privacy settings.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Analytics technologies may collect information about
                        website visits, pages viewed, referral sources, and
                        interactions. Google processes information under its
                        applicable terms and privacy policies.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Google Tag Manager is a tool for managing website tags.
                        Its presence does not mean every available tracking tag
                        is active. We aim to describe the services actually in use
                        and update this policy when our configuration materially
                        changes.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        For more information, review
                        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link link-primary">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="affiliates" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">4. Affiliate Links and Third-Party Websites</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may link to third-party retailers and product
                        discovery services, including Benable. Some links may be
                        affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you
                        make a qualifying purchase or complete another qualifying
                        action, at no additional cost to you unless otherwise
                        disclosed.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        When you follow an external link, the third party may
                        collect information under its own privacy policy and terms.
                        We do not control the privacy practices, content, security,
                        or data handling of external websites.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Please review the privacy policy of any third-party service
                        you visit before providing information or making a purchase.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="advertising" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">5. Advertising and Email Marketing</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Google AdSense advertising and email marketing subscriptions
                        are not currently active services on Findable Home as of
                        the date of this policy.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        If we introduce advertising, newsletters, or email
                        marketing in the future, we will update this policy to
                        explain the relevant information practices and choices
                        before or when those services become active, as required
                        by applicable law.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="sharing" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">6. How We Share Information</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">We do not sell personal information as a business practice. Information may be shared in limited circumstances:</p>
                    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 marker:text-primary">
                        <li>With service providers that help operate, secure, measure, or maintain the website.</li>
                        <li>With third-party services when you choose to visit or interact with them.</li>
                        <li>When required by law, valid legal process, or a legitimate request from an appropriate authority.</li>
                        <li>When reasonably necessary to protect the website, our rights, visitors, or others from fraud, abuse, or security threats.</li>
                        <li>In connection with a business transfer, if applicable and permitted by law.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We do not control how independent third parties use
                        information they collect directly from you.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="security" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">7. Data Retention and Security</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We retain information only for as long as reasonably
                        necessary for the purpose for which it was collected,
                        including responding to requests, maintaining records,
                        resolving disputes, and meeting legal obligations.
                        Retention periods may differ depending on the type of
                        information and the service involved.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We take reasonable steps to protect information, but no
                        website, transmission method, or electronic storage system
                        can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="choices" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">8. Your Privacy Choices and Rights</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Depending on where you live and the laws that apply, you
                        may have rights to request access to, correction of, or
                        deletion of certain personal information, or to object to
                        or restrict certain processing.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        You can also limit or delete cookies through your browser
                        settings. Blocking cookies may affect some website or
                        third-party functionality. Browser controls do not
                        necessarily prevent every form of measurement or data
                        collection.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        To ask a privacy question or make a request, contact us
                        using the details in the Contact section below. We may
                        need to verify your request where permitted or required
                        by law.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="children" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home is intended for a general audience and is
                        not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly
                        collect personal information directly from children under
                        13. If you believe a child has provided personal
                        information to us, please contact us so we can review
                        the matter and take appropriate steps.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="international" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">10. International Visitors</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home focuses on household solutions for a US
                        audience, but visitors may access the website from other
                        countries. Depending on your location and the services
                        used, information may be processed in countries other
                        than your own, subject to applicable legal requirements.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="changes" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        We may revise this Privacy Policy when our website,
                        services, or legal obligations change. The updated version
                        will be published on this page with a revised "Last
                        Updated" date. Please review this page periodically.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-1.5 bg-primary"></div>
                    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Questions about privacy?</span>
                        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">12. Contact Us</h2>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                            For privacy questions or requests, contact:
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5">
                            <p class="font-bold">Findable Home</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Email us at</p>
                            <a href="mailto:contact@findablehome.me" class="mt-1 inline-block break-all font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">
                                contact@findablehome.me
                            </a>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
                                <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <p class="px-1 py-3 text-center text-sm text-base-content/60">
                    Thank you for taking the time to understand how Findable Home handles privacy.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

